on quirk) produced 596 diff lines, so the equality above is meaningful.\n\n## Bugs deliberately preserved\n- `data = d[0]|...|(d[3]<<24)` in siphash is an `int` expression: for `d[3] >= 0x80` it goes negative and **sign-extends into all high bits** of `size_t`. Reproduced via `as i64 as u64` (and again in the `case 4:` fall-through).\n- `hash ^= hash ^ ROTR(hash,n)` no-ops, C switch fall-through, wrap-around arithmetic, `arrgrowf` returning `NULL` for zero-capacity requests, `arrfreef(NULL)` freeing a bogus pointer, and the asymmetric `stbds_temp_key` update in `hmput_key` (only the first inner loop sets it — this one even reproduces the resulting double-free/heap corruption in strdup mode identically).\n\nLayout compatibility is enforced by `const _: () = assert!(size_of::<...>() == ...)` for all five structs, and all allocation goes through libc `realloc`/`free` so blocks stay interchangeable with the C macros."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":568,"cache_read_input_tokens":146383,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":568,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c8d92879-0c1e-4153-86ba-da016aad109e","uuid":"f308ced1-72fb-40ad-a36a-e9f5d711fe4d","timestamp":"2026-08-27T04:57:46.635Z"}
